{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13189","headline":"酬张二仓曹扬子所居见寄兼呈韩郎中 · 皇甫冉","name":"酬张二仓曹扬子所居见寄兼呈韩郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤云独鹤自悠悠，别後经年尚泊舟。\n渔父置词相借问，郎官能赋许依投。\n折芳远寄三春草，乘兴闲看万里流。\n莫怪杜门频乞假，不堪扶病拜龙楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13189.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13189","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}